{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00895","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 钓竿篇 · 沈佺期","name":"鼓吹曲辞 钓竿篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝日敛红烟，垂竿向绿川。\n人疑天上坐，鱼似镜中悬。\n避檝时惊透，猜钩每误牵。\n湍危不理辖，潭静欲留船。\n钓玉君徒尚，徵金我未贤。\n爲看芳饵下，贪得会无全。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}